      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bilingual RAG Recruitment Agent (AI Agent) ##\n\n* **Purpose:** Answers prospective student inquiries in German or English strictly grounded in official program PDFs stored in Pinecone (`campus-recruitment-hub`).\n* **Program Routing:** Uses dedicated `Pinecone Vector Store` retrieval tools per program namespace (`prog-mscmgt`, `prog-bscbba`, `prog-mscgl`, `prog-mscbads`, `prog-mba`) with `models/gemini-embedding-001` and `Include Metadata` enabled.\n* **Memory & Guardrails:** Uses `Simple Memory` for multi-turn follow-up questions and a Markdown System Message enforcing language matching, zero hallucination, clarifying questions when the program is ambiguous, and `source_doc` citations.",
